        "name": "Backstab",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Shaco's basic attacks and Two-Shiv Poison deal additional damage when striking from behind.",
        "bodyHtml": "When striking enemies that are facing away from him:<span>Shaco's Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">((20 ~ 35) + (20% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> that can critically strike.<span><span>?</span> deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((15 ~ 50) + (10% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, increased to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((22.5 ~ 75) + (15% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> if the target is below 30% Health.",
