      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "Deceive",
        "name": "Deceive",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Shaco becomes Invisible and teleports to target location.<br><br>His first attack while Invisible is empowered, dealing bonus damage and critically striking if he attacks from behind.",
        "bodyHtml": "Shaco teleports and becomes <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Invisible</span> for 2.5/2.75/3/3.25/3.5 seconds. Using <span>Jack In The Box</span> or <span>Hallucinate</span> does not break <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Invisibility</span>.<br /><br />Shaco's next Attack while <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Invisible</span> deals an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(25/35/45/55/65 + (60% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. If striking from behind, this Attack critically strikes for (40% + (60% Critical Strike Damage)) damage.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The bonus damage on Attack can critically strike.<br /><span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Invisible</span> units cannot be revealed except by turrets or <span style=\"color: #ee91d7\">True Sight</font color>.</span>",
