      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "JackInTheBox",
        "name": "Jack In The Box",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Shaco creates a hidden animated Jack-in-the-Box. When triggered, it will fear and attack nearby enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Shaco creates a trap that stealths itself after 2 seconds and lasts for (40 + (10% Ability Power)) seconds. It activates when an enemy comes near or when revealed, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Fearing</span> nearby enemy Champions for 0.5/0.75/1/1.25/1.5 seconds, or 2 seconds for minions and jungle monsters.<br /><br />Once activated, the trap fires at all nearby enemies for 5 seconds, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(10/15/20/25/30 + (12% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, or <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(25/40/55/70/85 + (18% Ability Power)) damage</span> if focused on a single target.<br /><br />Jack in the Box's attacks deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">20/35/50/65/80</span> damage to monsters.",
