        "id": "TwoShivPoison",
        "name": "Two-Shiv Poison",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Shaco's Shivs passively poison targets on hit, slowing their Move Speed. He can throw his Shivs to deal damage and poison the target. The thrown Shiv deals bonus damage if the target is below 30% health.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> While this Ability is off Cooldown, Shaco's Attacks <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> the target by 20/22.5/25/27.5/30% for 2 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Shaco throws a shiv, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/95/120/145/170 + (80% bonus Attack Damage) + (60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> by 20/22.5/25/27.5/30% for 3 seconds. If the target has less than 30% Health, the shiv deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(105/142.5/180/217.5/255 + (120% bonus Attack Damage) + (90% Ability Power)) damage</span> instead.",
