      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "HallucinateFull",
        "name": "Hallucinate",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Shaco creates an illusion of himself near him, which can attack nearby enemies (Deals reduced damage to turrets).  Upon death, it explodes, spawning three mini Jack in the Boxes and dealing damage to nearby enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Shaco briefly disappears, then reappears with a clone that lasts 18 seconds and detonates when it dies, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/225/300 + (70% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and spawning three mini <span>Jack in the Boxes</span> that trigger immediately. The clone deals 60% of Shaco's damage and receives 50% increased damage.<br /><br />Mini <span>Jack in the Boxes</span> deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(10/20/30 + (10% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, or <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(25/50/75 + (15% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> if firing at only one enemy, and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Fear</span> for 1 second.<br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The clone can be controlled using the Alt key and right click, or by <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recasting</span> this Ability.</span>",
